{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>手機儲存空間不足時，往往難以判斷哪些相片與影片最佔位置。Photo Clean 會按已核實的原始檔案大小列出相片與影片，並可參考估計檢視日期找出較舊項目，適合想定期整理相簿、騰出空間的用戶。原價 US $0.99，現時限時免費。</p>\n<img alt=\"限時免費\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/460x460Icon-Ap-SiOS01-75-42.webp\">\n<h2>按檔案大小篩選佔位相片</h2>\n<p>畫面按已核實的原始檔案大小列出相片與影片，方便優先處理最佔空間的項目；亦可參考估計檢視日期，找出較舊而未必再需要的內容。可先預覽再批次選取多個項目。未知大小的項目只會在確認後才下載，過程或會耗用流動數據、電量與儲存空間；刪除項目仍留在最近刪除相簿。</p>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-439-scaled.jpg\">\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-440-scaled.jpg\">\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-441-scaled.jpg\">\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-442-scaled.jpg\">\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：Photo Clean: Photo Organizer</li>\n<li>應用類別：Photo &amp; Video</li>\n<li>下載位置：App Store</li>\n</ul>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-22T11:21:44.916181+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":319,"images":5,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-22T11:12:39+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-22T22:58:30.682760+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-22T11:17:41.571306+00:00","content_hash":"de652dedaaabefd4e72466a809d5784f80d90d52b71b4ba726007f693d1ab0d7","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}